WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:01.710
- All right before we say goodbye,

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:04.070
I have one more story of
positivity, I wanna share.

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:05.454
This is "What I'm Liking."

00:00:05.454 --> 00:00:06.722
(upbeat music)

00:00:06.722 --> 00:00:07.883
(crowd cheering)

00:00:07.883 --> 00:00:08.716
All right, y'all,

00:00:08.716 --> 00:00:10.640
it's almost the official start of summer

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:13.600
and that means laying by the
pool or heading to the beach.

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:15.440
I know a lot of people
dread this time of year

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:17.380
because, well, it means
putting on a swimsuit

00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:19.440
or even worse, a wet suit.

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:22.090
Which is the worst thing
in the world to put on,

00:00:22.090 --> 00:00:23.690
if you've ever done it.

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:25.530
It's SPANX from hell.
(crowd chuckle)

00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:27.160
Well, now there's an organization

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:30.060
that's helping encourage
wetsuits for all body types,

00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:31.980
I welcome this, but even more than that,

00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:34.820
they're promoting body
positivity among female surfers

00:00:34.820 --> 00:00:36.680
and we can all use that message.

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:38.190
And on the line right
now to talk about it,

00:00:38.190 --> 00:00:41.260
is the founder of Curvy
Surfer Girl, Elizabeth.

00:00:41.260 --> 00:00:44.581
She watches on Hawaii News
Now, what's up, Elizabeth?

00:00:44.581 --> 00:00:45.477
(crowd applauding)
(crowd cheering)

00:00:45.477 --> 00:00:48.580
- Aloha y'all, Aloha Kelly (chuckles).

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:49.790
- Oh my gosh.
- Thank you so much

00:00:49.790 --> 00:00:51.010
for having me.

00:00:51.010 --> 00:00:52.050
- Absolutely.

00:00:52.050 --> 00:00:54.000
But does everybody look just fabulous

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:55.560
and beautiful and glowy in Hawaii?

00:00:55.560 --> 00:00:57.492
'Cause I need to move there.

00:00:57.492 --> 00:00:59.050
(both laughing)

00:00:59.050 --> 00:01:01.620
Elizabeth, what inspired
you to start this movement?

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:04.310
- Well, I really wanted
to show that every woman

00:01:04.310 --> 00:01:08.010
of any size, age, background is capable

00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:09.970
of surfing and being an athlete.

00:01:09.970 --> 00:01:12.360
And so we started the
Curvy Surfer Girl movement

00:01:12.360 --> 00:01:14.503
about two years ago to do that.

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:17.220
You know, when I first started surfing,

00:01:17.220 --> 00:01:19.820
I really felt excluded from surf culture

00:01:19.820 --> 00:01:22.450
because I am a plus size, curvy woman.

00:01:22.450 --> 00:01:26.290
And unfortunately at that
time, there were no swimsuits

00:01:26.290 --> 00:01:29.900
or wetsuits that were
being designed in my size

00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:32.010
and it just made me feel left out.

00:01:32.010 --> 00:01:33.500
And so I said, "You know what?

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:36.990
Rather than waiting for
the surf industry to change

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:38.690
let's get a community together

00:01:38.690 --> 00:01:40.750
and make that change happen ourselves."

00:01:40.750 --> 00:01:42.250
- I love that initiative.

00:01:42.250 --> 00:01:43.800
So, this is really working.

00:01:43.800 --> 00:01:46.270
What's happened since
starting Curvy Surfer Girl?

00:01:46.270 --> 00:01:49.210
- So, since starting Curvy
Surfer Girl, I partnered up

00:01:49.210 --> 00:01:52.370
with one of the largest surf
brands in the world, Rip Curl

00:01:52.370 --> 00:01:55.090
and I got eight curvy and
diverse women together

00:01:55.090 --> 00:01:57.350
and we did a massive surfing campaign.

00:01:57.350 --> 00:01:59.440
It was heard around the world

00:01:59.440 --> 00:02:02.410
and since then it's
just continued to evolve

00:02:02.410 --> 00:02:04.170
and include more and more women.

00:02:04.170 --> 00:02:06.560
I've actually partnered
up with small businesses

00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:09.330
and we've been working
to expand swimsuit sizing

00:02:09.330 --> 00:02:12.310
for performance wear,
whether you're free-diving,

00:02:12.310 --> 00:02:14.050
you're surfing, you're jet skiing,

00:02:14.050 --> 00:02:17.020
you're inner tubing, it
doesn't really matter,

00:02:17.020 --> 00:02:20.180
we all need performance
swim to do the things

00:02:20.180 --> 00:02:22.170
that we love in the
water and in the ocean.

00:02:22.170 --> 00:02:24.420
So, that's what we're here doing

00:02:24.420 --> 00:02:26.980
and it's just continuing to grow.

00:02:26.980 --> 00:02:29.710
Recently, I started working with JOLYN

00:02:29.710 --> 00:02:32.280
and we're gonna be coming out with our own

00:02:32.280 --> 00:02:35.780
extensive plus size swimsuit
collection for surfing

00:02:35.780 --> 00:02:39.640
and it's going to include
wetsuits next spring.

00:02:39.640 --> 00:02:42.440
- All right, make those
easier to put on ma'am.

00:02:42.440 --> 00:02:44.200
Thank you so much, Elizabeth.

00:02:44.200 --> 00:02:45.170
(crowd applauding)
This is such a cool thing

00:02:45.170 --> 00:02:47.820
that you're doing, not only
for yourself, but so many.

00:02:47.820 --> 00:02:50.610
I'm liking your post right now, right?

00:02:50.610 --> 00:02:52.026
(heart dinging)
- Thank you.

00:02:52.026 --> 00:02:52.859
